(2. Maternity Benefit for Second Living Child \(Girl Child Incentive\):) Tj
0 -14 Td
(For the second living child, eligible mothers receive a one-time maternity benefit of Rs. 6,000 in a single instalment after childbirth, provided the second child is a girl child.) Tj
